[18.691579, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[8B\u001b[48;5;255m\u001b[38;5;248m❯ \u001b[38;5;241mFinance says our money rounding is wrong: div_cents() in \u001b[39m           \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;5;241mapp/money.py drops fractions of a cent, but amounts must round half\u001b[39m \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;5;241mup (for example, 7% tax on 1050 cents must be 74 cents, not 73). \u001b[39m   \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;5;241mtests/test_money.py pins the required behaviour; you can run it \u001b[39m    \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;5;241mwith python3 -m pytest tests/test_money.py. Fix it and tell me when\u001b[39m \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;5;241mit is done. Do not commit; do not push.\u001b[39m                             \r\u001b[47C\u001b[6B\u001b[49m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;174m*\u001b[3GSwir\u001b[38;5;216mlin\u001b[38;5;174mg… \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;241mtmux focus-events off · add 'set -g focus-events on' to ~/.tmux.c…\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;246m──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;241m❯ \r\u001b[41C\u001b[2B · esc to interrupt · ← fo…\u001b[39m\u001b[30;1H\u001b[28;3H\u001b[?25h"]
